s://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T09:49:04Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T09:49:04Z","body":"@precup In https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108435 you said it bisected to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106661 which is different from the bisection https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269 mentioned here","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3126435099/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137141835","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108985#issuecomment-3137141835","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108985","id":3137141835,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66_PxL","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T16:56:26Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T16:56:26Z","body":"We mentioned this today in the core meeting and I hadn't seen it, but unfortunately the MRP is too big to load on my PC (I spent an hour trying). I'm also not clear from the text above whether this is due to physics interpolation or something else.\n\nHere's some tip here on producing an MRP I wrote a few years ago:\nhttps://github.com/lawnjelly/Misc/blob/master/MRP2.md","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137141835/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137335244","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108985#issuecomment-3137335244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108985","id":3137335244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66_-_M","user":{"login":"Jamsers","id":39361911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MzYxOTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39361911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers","html_url":"https://github.com/Jamsers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jamsers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T18:00:20Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T18:00:20Z","body":"I've pushed some changes to the MRP repo (branch) that should make it easier to open, while making sure that the performance regression is preserved\n\n- deleted an unused, very huge model that you'd likely get stuck on in the importing stage when initially opening the project\n- deleted as many systems nodes as possible and disabled as many graphics effects as possible\n- implemented a \"bootloader\" shim main node so that when opening the project, it doesn't automatically load into the very heavy main scene\n\nI've confirmed the performance regression is preserved - even after these changes, I still get 10 FPS on 4.5 and 35 FPS on 4.4.\n\nUnfortunately due to the nature of the performance regression's trigger, the absurdly node dense nature of the main scene has to remain. (So actually opening the main scene manually will still be a very heavy operation)\n\nI heavily recommend disabling \"view gizmos\" before opening the main scene - the sheer amount of gizmos that have to be rendered kills performance in the editor\n\nI suspect the trigger of the performance regression is the very many rigidbody nodes in the scene, all of which have physics interpolation enabled on them.\n\nI noticed something while stripping down the project - disabling the sun's shadows improves FPS on 4.5 from 10 to 30. However, disabling the sun's shadows also improves FPS on 4.4 from 35 to 55, so a regression is still in play. But I found it interesting that disabling shadows alone would affect performance, when everything else i've done doesn't affect performance","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137335244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137477930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108985#issuecomment-3137477930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108985","id":3137477930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67Ah0q","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T18:51:35Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T18:51:35Z","body":"I tested the updated MRP on 4.4-stable, 4.5-beta3, and a master from 2 days ago.\n\n<img width=\"741\" height=\"565\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa91ef1d-a3fb-4c0b-bdbe-3a022c1e7773\" />\n\nI tested them all twice because the first time (the right column) I had something else intensive running that I forgot about. It should've been flat load, so the results should still be meaningful, but the left column is really the cleaner test.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137477930/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137504129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108985#issuecomment-3137504129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108985","id":3137504129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67AoOB","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T19:02:01Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T19:07:03Z","body":"Sounds like the major performance regression has already been solved then based on @precup's figures.\n\nI can't remember the state in 4.5 beta 3, but it may have been before optimizations to `SceneTreeFTI` so you were hitting worst case where it traversed the whole scene tree.\n\nSee e.g. #106244 .\n\nOr it may have not been to do with physics interpolation, can't know without profiling.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137504129/reactions","total_